<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover">
    <title>PAPER RUSH - Tor-AI</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/magicrush.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div id="rotate-warning">
        <i class="fas fa-mobile-screen fa-rotate-90"></i>
        <p>가로 모드로 회전해주세요!</p>
    </div>

    <div id="game-container">
        <canvas id="game-canvas"></canvas>

        <div class="hud">
            <div class="stats-panel">
                <div class="stat-box">
                    <span class="label">STAGE</span>
                    <span class="value" id="stage-display">1</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-box">
                    <span class="label">SCORE</span>
                    <span class="value" id="score-display" style="color: #0ff;">0</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-box best">
                    <span class="label">BEST</span>
                    <span class="value" id="best-score"><%= user.paper_rush_best_score || 0 %></span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="wind-indicator" id="wind-indicator">
                <span class="label">WIND</span>
                <i class="fas fa-arrow-right" id="wind-arrow"></i>
                <span class="wind-power" id="wind-power">0</span>
            </div>
            <div class="combo-display" id="combo-display" style="display: none;">
                COMBO x<span id="combo-value">1</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="start-screen" class="overlay-screen">
            <h1 class="glitch" data-text="PAPER RUSH">PAPER RUSH</h1>
            <p>바람을 타고 사이버펑크 도시를 돌파하세요!</p>
            <p class="desc">화면을 탭(또는 스페이스바)하여 상승. 바람의 방향과 위험 요소를 주의하세요.</p>
            <button id="start-btn">START FLIGHT</button>
            <div id="start-rank-info">Loading Leaderboard...</div>
            <a href="/dashboard" class="back-btn">Back to Dashboard</a>
        </div>

        <div id="game-over-screen" class="overlay-screen" style="display: none;">
            <h1 style="color: #ff0055;">CRASHED!</h1>
            <div class="final-stats">
                <p>STAGE: <span id="final-stage"></span></p>
                <p>SCORE: <span id="final-score"></span></p>
                <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: #ffcc00;" id="taunt-msg"></p>
            </div>
            <button id="restart-btn">RETRY FLIGHT</button>
            <div id="end-rank-info">Loading Leaderboard...</div>
            <a href="/dashboard" class="back-btn">Back to Dashboard</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Full screen tap area -->
        <div id="tap-area"></div>
    </div>

    <script>
        window.GAME_USER = {
            id: parseInt("<%= user.id %>"),
            username: "<%= user.username %>",
            attempts: parseInt("<%= user.paper_rush_attempts || 0 %>"),
            bestScore: parseInt("<%= user.paper_rush_best_score || 0 %>"),
            level: parseInt("<%= user.paper_rush_level || 1 %>"),
            shield: parseInt("<%= user.paper_rush_shield || 0 %>"),
            multiplier: parseInt("<%= user.paper_rush_multiplier || 1 %>"),
            platform: parseInt("<%= user.paper_rush_platform || 0 %>")
        };
    </script>
    <script src="/js/magicrush.js"></script>
</body>
</html>